{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change your perspective, and the world transforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The story of a girl who lost all her memories and sets out to find the truth and <strong>'her own eyes'</strong>.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dimension Ascent</strong> is a multi-dimensional puzzle-action platformer that utilizes perspective shifts and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Key Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/316436beddd9bddc6f6150a785aae97f.poster.avif?t=1771985484\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/316436beddd9bddc6f6150a785aae97f.webm?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/316436beddd9bddc6f6150a785aae97f.mp4?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The core gameplay revolves around 'rotating the map by changing your viewpoint.'</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This perspective manipulation mechanism evolves into various forms of rotation-based play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Object Perspective ]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/75e8ed57993a188329f3cda7234303d9.poster.avif?t=1771985484\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/75e8ed57993a188329f3cda7234303d9.webm?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/75e8ed57993a188329f3cda7234303d9.mp4?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Side-View Switching ]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/4fa36f3c724b6b846e58c3475de1b2fc.poster.avif?t=1771985484\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/4fa36f3c724b6b846e58c3475de1b2fc.webm?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/4fa36f3c724b6b846e58c3475de1b2fc.mp4?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Seamless Rotation ]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/3504863a439319df520e7d109a26f649.poster.avif?t=1771985484\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/3504863a439319df520e7d109a26f649.webm?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/3504863a439319df520e7d109a26f649.mp4?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many other rotation mechanics as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The NPCs in this world are more than mere supporting characters. They are beings with a unique way of looking at the world\u2014they have their own <strong>'Eyes.'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC possesses a unique ability, and this ability itself becomes a core game mechanic and the foundation of the map design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Space Manipulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/05ff370fa74e4447ad0adffcb0cb7833.poster.avif?t=1771985484\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/05ff370fa74e4447ad0adffcb0cb7833.webm?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/05ff370fa74e4447ad0adffcb0cb7833.mp4?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 <strong>Black &amp; White Switching</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/c12a50dc28644f5633d0a575f3f178f0.poster.avif?t=1771985484\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/c12a50dc28644f5633d0a575f3f178f0.webm?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/c12a50dc28644f5633d0a575f3f178f0.mp4?t=1771985484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience novel gameplay by utilizing the NPCs' powers, where the abilities themselves become a unique narrative delivery system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of <strong>6 NPCs</strong> with unique personalities appear!